<span class="ltx_bibblock">
Ziyang Xiao, Jingrong Xie, Lilin Xu, Shisi Guan, Jingyan Zhu, Xiongwei Han, Xiaojin Fu, WingYin Yu, Han Wu, Wei Shi, Qingcan Kang, Jiahui Duan, Tao Zhong, Mingxuan Yuan, Jia Zeng, Yuan Wang, Gang Chen, and Dongxiang Zhang.

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">A survey of optimization modeling meets llms: Progress and future directions, 2025.

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">URL <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10047" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10047</a>.

</span></li>
      
