<div id="alg1.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">7:</span>
            
            
             <span id="alg1.l7.2" class="ltx_text">// Row normalization</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">8:</span>
            
            
             <math id="alg1.l8.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\tilde{M}\leftarrow\mathrm{diag}(\|\tilde{M}_{1,:}\|_{p}^{-1},\ldots,\|\tilde{M}_{m,:}\|_{p}^{-1})\tilde{M}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>M</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mi>diag</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>M</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>M</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>M</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{M}\leftarrow\mathrm{diag}(\|\tilde{M}_{1,:}\|_{p}^{-1},\ldots,\|\tilde{M}_{m,:}\|_{p}^{-1})\tilde{M}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">9:</span>
            
            
             <span id="alg1.l9.2" class="ltx_text">// Column normalization</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">10:</span>
            
            
             <math id="alg1.l10.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\tilde{M}\leftarrow\tilde{M}\,\mathrm{diag}(\|\tilde{M}_{:,1}\|_{p}^{-1},\ldots,\|\tilde{M}_{:,n}\|_{p}^{-1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>M</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>M</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>diag</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>M</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mo rspace="0em">:</mo><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>M</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mo rspace="0em">:</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{M}\leftarrow\tilde{M}\,\mathrm{diag}(\|\tilde{M}_{:,1}\|_{p}^{-1},\ldots,\|\tilde{M}_{:,n}\|_{p}^{-1})</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l11" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">11:</span>
            
            
            <span id="alg1.l11.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l11.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l12" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">12:</span>
            
            
            <span id="alg1.l12.2" class="ltx_text">// Scale to target RMS value</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l13" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">13:</span>
            
            
            <math id="alg1.l13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{M}_{k+1}\leftarrow\tilde{M}\cdot\frac{\rho_{\mathrm{target}}}{\mathrm{RMS}(\tilde{M})}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>M</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>M</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>target</mi></msub><mrow><mi>RMS</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>M</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{M}_{k+1}\leftarrow\tilde{M}\cdot\frac{\rho_{\mathrm{target}}}{\mathrm{RMS}(\tilde{M})}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l14" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">14:</span>
            
            
            <span id="alg1.l14.2" class="ltx_text">// Update weights with regularized gradient</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l15" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">15:</span>
            
            
            <math id="alg1.l15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="W_{k+1}\leftarrow W_{k}-\alpha(\hat{M}_{k+1}+\lambda W_{k})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>M</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">W_{k+1}\leftarrow W_{k}-\alpha(\hat{M}_{k+1}+\lambda W_{k})</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l16" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">16:</span>
            
            
          <span id="alg1.l16.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l16.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
</div>
</figure>
<div id="A4.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.p4.1" class="ltx_p">The specific optimizer used throughout our experiments is a special case of Algorithm <a href="#alg1" title="Algorithm 1 ‣ Appendix D The REG Regularization Operator ‣ REG: A Regularization Optimizer for Robust Training Dynamics" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> where the normalization iteration count is set to <math id="A4.p4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t=1</annotation></semantics></math>. While values of <math id="A4.p4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t&gt;1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t&gt;1</annotation></semantics></math> were found to yield marginal performance improvements, these gains were not statistically significant in our experimental setting.</p>
</div>
</section>
